{"4229880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Souq Boss Simulator", "steam_appid": 4229880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’ve managed supermarkets before. But have you ever run a baqala in the Arabian Gulf in 2002?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your baqala, build relationships with neighborhood regulars, chase thieves with your BB Gun, expand your store, and invest your Foloos in other businesses around town. Experience an old-school Arabian Gulf neighborhood inspired by Dubai and Riyadh before the  glamour. Your goal is to become the Souq Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">👇الترجمة العربية الكاملة موجودة أدناه👇</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/e41c8bfb3b25f5fe63ffe408197f4527.poster.avif?t=1788260773\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/e41c8bfb3b25f5fe63ffe408197f4527.webm?t=1788260773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/e41c8bfb3b25f5fe63ffe408197f4527.mp4?t=1788260773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>EXPERIENCE THE ARABIAN GULF BEFORE THE GLAMOUR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by developers who grew up in the Gulf, the neighborhood is packed with the places, characters and details we remember. From shisha cafés and internet cafés to mosques, bakeries, construction sites and empty sand lots.   <br> <br>Welcome to the neighborhood. Your baqala is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/122d053529b7ba6ae5d899ce8c9c8336.poster.avif?t=1788260773\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/122d053529b7ba6ae5d899ce8c9c8336.webm?t=1788260773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/122d053529b7ba6ae5d899ce8c9c8336.mp4?t=1788260773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUN YOUR BAQALA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order products, stock your shelves, set prices and serve customers as you try to turn a small neighborhood store into a growing business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But running a baqala isn't always peaceful... <br>Keep an eye out for thieves — and grab your BB Gun when someone tries to make a run for it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/d264ce79257a142b19b72b33f3807ea4.poster.avif?t=1788260773\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/d264ce79257a142b19b72b33f3807ea4.webm?t=1788260773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/d264ce79257a142b19b72b33f3807ea4.mp4?t=1788260773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET TO KNOW THE NEIGHBORHOOD </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet neighborhood regulars like Abu Khaled, learn what they want, complete their requests and build relationships with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up those relationships to <strong>unlock special items, new stores, skins and more. </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE FOLOOS. SPEND FOLOOS. MAKE MORE FOLOOS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growing your store is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your baqala and use your profits to invest in other businesses around town, including the local Shisha Cafe, creating new sources of income as you build your neighborhood business empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">قد أدرت سوبرماركت من قبل... لكن هل سبق وأدرت بقالة في الخليج سنة 2002؟</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">أدر بقالتك، ابنِ علاقات مع زباين الحي، لاحق الحرامية بمسدس البي بي، وسّع محلك، واستثمر فلوسك في مشاريع ثانية حول المدينة. عِش أجواء حي خليجي من أيام أول، مستوحى من دبي والرياض قبل الأبراج والفخامة. هدفك إنك تصير سوق بوس </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\">عِش أجواء الخليج قبل الأبراج والفخامة</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">اللعبة من تطوير فريق عاش وكبر في الخليج، وعشان كذا الحي مليان بالأماكن والشخصيات والتفاصيل اللي نتذكرها. من مقاهي الشيشة والإنترنت إلى المساجد والمخابز ومواقع البناء والأراضي الرملية الفاضية حياك في الحي. بقالتك تنتظرك</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\"> أَدِر بقالتك</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">اطلب البضاعة، عبّي الرفوف، حدد الأسعار وخدم الزباين، وحاول تحوّل بقالتك الصغيرة إلى مشروع يكبر يوم بعد يوم.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">...بس إدارة البقالة مو دايما هادية</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">خلك منتبه للحرامية — وإذا واحد حاول يهرب بالبضاعة، طلع مسدس البي بي</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\"> تعرّف على أهل الحي</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">تعرّف على زباين الحي الدائمين مثل أبو خالد، اعرف وش يحبون ووش يحتاجون، نفّذ طلباتهم وطوّر علاقتك معهم</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">كل ما طورت علاقتك فيهم، تقدر تفتح أغراض خاصة، محلات جديدة، سكنات وأكثر</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\"> اجمع فلوس. اصرف فلوس. وطلّع فلوس أكثر.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">توسعة بقالتك مجرد البداية</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">كبّر بقالتك واستخدم أرباحك عشان تستثمر في مشاريع ثانية حول المدينة، مثل مقهى الشيشة، وافتح لك مصادر دخل جديدة وأنت تبني إمبراطوريتك التجارية في الحي</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’ve managed supermarkets before. But have you ever run a baqala in the Arabian Gulf in 2002?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your baqala, build relationships with neighborhood regulars, chase thieves with your BB Gun, expand your store, and invest your Foloos in other businesses around town. Experience an old-school Arabian Gulf neighborhood inspired by Dubai and Riyadh before the  glamour. Your goal is to become the Souq Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">👇الترجمة العربية الكاملة موجودة أدناه👇</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/e41c8bfb3b25f5fe63ffe408197f4527.poster.avif?t=1788260773\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/e41c8bfb3b25f5fe63ffe408197f4527.webm?t=1788260773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229880/extras/e41c8bfb3b25f5fe63ffe408197f4527.mp4?t=1788260773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>EXPERIENCE THE ARABIAN GULF BEFORE THE GLAMOUR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by developers who grew up in the Gulf, the neighborhood is packed with the places, characters and details we remember. From shisha cafés and internet cafés to mosques, bakeries, construction sites and empty sand lots.   <br> <br>Welcome to the neighborhood. Your baqala is waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline